    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "r8ux0xfx1vc8",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "I remember that I used to think "
     },
     {
      "_key": "29xohrkpa08o",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "champagne"
     },
     {
      "_key": "1199i4r7bd2g",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " was only for desserts. Then, as I learned to appreciate it and discover its subtleties, I remembered one essential thing: "
     },
     {
      "_key": "k9yrmh729x4g",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "champagne is first and foremost a wine"
     },
     {
      "_key": "c9uy6rgjuo0q",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "tkiewfybx39v",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "91c6i5ddkay1",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "And like any great wine, it can accompany a meal from starter to dessert, as long as you choose the right style and pair it with the right dishes. That is where the art of "
     },
     {
      "_key": "uox89r05ios4",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "food and champagne pairing"
     },
     {
      "_key": "akwyem8wp1xy",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " comes into its own."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "993dfiqo041d",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2k2b6iki52zy",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "What to eat with champagne?"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "72q2gp94hqxt",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "w0fmz49axpcn",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Pairing a dish with a champagne is not just a matter of habit:"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "qlj2gjhydrn2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "6uakqs8kqwf6",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Harmony of flavours"
     },
     {
      "_key": "f9ygrkk26wql",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ": champagne can balance the acidity of a dish, bring freshness to a rich one, or underline the finesse of a delicate recipe."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "enxo2r0mo0hh",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "oy54k1eq7v4z",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "The effect of the bubbles"
     },
     {
      "_key": "gd89u9mfo8sn",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ": they play a key role by « cleansing » the palate, bringing lightness and liveliness, and cutting through richness."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "kuu6yn0h286c",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "q4pwid53jb8b",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Mutual enhancement"
     },
     {
      "_key": "re6gtegh7k3e",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ": a successful pairing brings out the best in both the dish and the champagne."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "a0o16ks6l2sp",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "c6gvzczvz2r1",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "A tasting experience"
     },
     {
      "_key": "flblzyfsgzls",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": ": stepping off the beaten track lets you rediscover champagne throughout a meal."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "84lmsnb6ld8y",
