     {
      "_key": "j2fuefu5u7y7",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Mistakes to avoid in food and champagne pairing"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "a6cps3g4l0sz",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "q42udaxoz9ly",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Serving a very dry champagne with a sweet dessert → risk of bitterness."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "axumm9he8x4a",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "hs3jfdjqfc3a",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Pairing a powerful champagne with a delicate dish → unbalanced flavours."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "bceuhrtngcq2",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "8r2r6mdr5083",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Neglecting serving temperature: too cold, a champagne loses its aromas; too warm, it becomes heavy."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "858fp05qzlyd",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "75uh1kzrz7s3",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "One piece of advice: stay curious"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "btqxig8ssw7j",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "mgxqvg7v2tic",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "The art of food and champagne pairing is not a set of fixed rules: everyone has their own palate, and the best discovery can come from an unexpected try. Explore combinations and note the ones you prefer. Champagne is a wine in its own right, which can accompany a whole meal. Thanks to bubbles that refresh the palate and balance rich dishes, it is an ideal table companion. Taking time to choose the right pairing, while leaving room for curiosity, is a way to get to know the cuvées and the people who make them better."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   }
  ],
  "fr": [
   {
    "_key": "35970e01512f",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "35016164e47e",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Je me rappelle, à l’époque, je pensais que le "
     },
     {
      "_key": "6a4183e33b0f",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "champagne"
     },
     {
      "_key": "1fa619bb6775",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " était "
     },
     {
      "_key": "1fa619bb6775r",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "réservé aux desserts."
     },
     {
      "_key": "1fa619bb6775a",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " Puis, en apprenant à l’aimer et à en découvrir les subtilités, je me suis rappelé d’une chose essentielle : "
     },
     {
      "_key": "dd2e99da9bb3",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "le champagne, c’est avant tout un vin"
     },
     {
      "_key": "1429c63a216c",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "4b4b99b0a969",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "1e309e308ed3",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Et comme tout grand vin, il peut accompagner un repas de l’entrée au dessert, à condition de choisir le bon style et de l’associer aux bons plats. C’est là que l’art des "
     },
     {
      "_key": "33743748a4ae",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "accords mets et champagne"
     },
     {
      "_key": "cc7df56251ba",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " prend toute sa dimension."
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "105f765e120e",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "33fe42dc9ce8",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Quoi manger avec du champagne?"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "h2"
   },
   {
    "_key": "52c10076202e",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "e412aca442e1",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "Associer un plat et un champagne "
     },
     {
      "_key": "e412aca442e1r",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": "n’est pas qu’une question d’habitude :"
     }
    ],
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "69a0a7a284ab",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2f1a486e9859",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Harmonie des saveurs"
     },
     {
      "_key": "9ad509774eb5",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " : le champagne peut équilibrer l’acidité d’un plat, apporter de la fraîcheur à un mets riche, ou souligner la finesse d’une recette délicate."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
    "_key": "7695087678f1",
    "_type": "block",
    "children": [
     {
      "_key": "2f934db74709",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [
       "strong"
      ],
      "text": "Effet pétillant"
     },
     {
      "_key": "dbd4de25e3e5",
      "_type": "span",
      "marks": [],
      "text": " : les bulles jouent un rôle clé en “nettoyant” le palais, apportant légèreté et vivacité, tout en coupant la sensation de gras dans un plat."
     }
    ],
    "level": 1,
    "listItem": "bullet",
    "markDefs": [],
    "style": "normal"
   },
   {
